# Build context hygiene for the gateway image (v0.50.0-dev E-02). The image installs the engine's npm dependencies from the
# lock inside the build (`npm ci --omit=dev`); a host node_modules (with dev deps, or a symlink) must never reach it.
**/node_modules
.venv
build
dist/runtime
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
